{"id":"lele-143","title":"202212 青少年软件编程等级考试Scratch一级真题","subject":"scratch","subjectName":"电子学会Scratch","level":1,"yearmonth":"202212","year":"2022","count":37,"questions":[{"no":1,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小明想在开始表演之前向大家问好并做自我介绍，应运行下列哪个程序？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818086736594.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818086919720.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818087013712.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818087104517.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818087213582.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"外观积木配合显示时间，才能看清楚内容。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"舞台有两个不同的背景，小猫角色的哪个积木能够切换舞台背景？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818089771123.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818089934428.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818090027019.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818090096865.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818090187710.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"“下一个背景”积木可以切换舞台背景。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小兔子从下图初始位置到洞口距离是300步，下列哪个程序最先让小兔子回到洞口？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818090686378.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818093036920.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818093132377.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818093225744.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818093329745.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"移动300步，A选项只需要2秒钟。","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小猫的初始位置如图所示，要想让小猫走到屏幕左下角，应该运行下列哪个程序？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818093689830.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818093903644.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818094222929.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818094345911.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818094425152.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"先向左移动200步，再向下移动120步，能够移到左下角。","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"点击下列哪个按钮可以运行程序？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818094888316.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818094973909.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818095063569.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818095172805.png"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"点击绿旗按钮可以运行程序。","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个选项说法正确？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：程序在编写过程中会自动保存"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：点击“文件”中的“保存到电脑”，可以将程序保存到电脑"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：保存的程序名称后缀为.sprite3"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：保存程序以后，程序的名字不能再修改"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"点击“文件”中的“保存到电脑”，然后选择特定路径，这里可以修改作品的名称，就可以将作品保存到电脑里特定的地方。","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个按钮可以生成随机角色？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818097037297.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818097127075.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818097218648.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818097317596.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个绘图工具可以绘制圣诞树造型？（　）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818097789428.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818097942201.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818098015565.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818098095415.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818098199162.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"圣诞树由很多线段组成，圆圆可能使用了绘制线段的工具，其他3项无法实现绘制直线的效果。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如下图所示，字母角色有4个造型，第3个造型的名称是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818098606440.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：造型3"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：造型1"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：c"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：d"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"在左侧可以看到，第3个造型的名称为“c”。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小明将拍摄的多张照片添加到背景里，下列哪个积木不能实现照片的切换效果？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818100469119.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818100532630.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818100614837.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818100718476.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"照片添加到了背景中，B选项只能切换角色的造型，不能实现背景的切换。","auto":true},{"no":11,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"当前背景为“冬”，下列哪个程序可以将背景切换为“春”？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818101139372.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818101329304.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818101415979.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818101509266.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818101583321.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"选项A先将背景切换为春天，然后再切换到下一个背景为夏天； 选项B当前背景为冬天，切换到下一个背景为春天； 选项C当前背景为冬天，连着切换2次下一个背景为夏天； 选项D当前背景为冬天，切换到上一个背景为秋天。","auto":true},{"no":12,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小雨制作了一个电子蛋糕，可以实现点燃蜡烛和吹灭蜡烛的效果，下列可以实现先点燃蜡烛，过5秒后吹灭蜡烛的程序是？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818102111501.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818102287648.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818102374494.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818102472540.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818102552237.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"根据题意可知，要先将造型切换为“cake-a”，此时蜡烛为点燃效果，过5秒后，切换为“cake-b”造型，此时为吹灭效果，故选项A正确。","auto":true},{"no":13,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下图为小猫角色的初始方向，哪个积木可以让小猫面向正右方？（　）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818102989379.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818103157278.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818103266353.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818103362029.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818103446150.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"小猫的初始方向为面向正下方，向左旋转90度可以面向正右方。","auto":true},{"no":14,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"赛车只有一个造型，水平向右，小雨想让赛车向左转弯，他需要用到下列哪个模块中的积木？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：外观"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：控制"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：运动"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：侦测"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"左转积木位于运动模块中，可以让角色向左旋转一定度数。","auto":true},{"no":15,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列哪个选项可以实现雪花降落的效果？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818104457898.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818104677944.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818104751175.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818104848703.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818104937842.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"向下降落的效果需要角色面向下方再移动，面向下方为面向180方向，故D选项正确。","auto":true},{"no":16,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色的旋转方式为任意旋转，下列哪个积木能让角色旋转改变方向？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818105427533.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818105525868.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818105613035.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818105719180.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"选项A改变角色的造型，选项C可以让角色显示，选项D可以改变角色的位置。","auto":true},{"no":17,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色的旋转方式为任意旋转，下列哪个选项能实现点击绿旗运行程序后，角色先右转再移动的效果？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818106163634.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818106244426.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818106335015.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818106462795.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"根据题意可知，积木的拼接顺序为当绿旗被点击后，角色向右转，然后再移动，故选项A正确。","auto":true},{"no":18,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"角色有多个造型，下列哪个程序可以实现边播放音乐边切换造型？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818106901628.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818106983578.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818107068367.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818107153421.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"“播放声音”积木可以播放设定的声音，同时程序会执行这个积木后面的脚本，可以实现角色边播放边切换造型的效果；“播放声音等待播完”积木也可以播放设定的声音，但是等待声音播完后才能执行这个积木后面的脚本，可以实现角色播放完声音后再切换造型的效果；故选项A正确。","auto":true},{"no":19,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"齐齐想让程序中的一段音乐加快速度，他需要到哪里操作呢？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818107559918.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：A"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：B"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：C"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：D"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"可以到声音区对音效进行调整，包括将声音变响、变轻、变快、变慢等操作。","auto":true},{"no":20,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小雨在听到一首歌时非常喜欢，于是下载到了电脑上，他想把这首歌作为程序的背景音乐，应该怎么操作呢？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：从声音库中选择一个声音"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：复制一个声音"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：随机生成一个声音"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：从电脑本地上传一个声音"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"可以通过上传声音将电脑上的歌曲上传到程序中。","auto":true},{"no":21,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小雨在编程的时候，不小心拼错了积木，导致程序没有声音了。下列能让声音消失的程序是？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818108796249.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818108895396.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818108983335.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818109075775.png"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"音量的值越小，声音越小，当音量的值为0时，声音将会消失；音调的值越小，声音越沉闷，值越大声音越清脆，当音调为0时不会让声音消失；故选项A正确。","auto":true},{"no":22,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"黑兔、灰兔和白兔在赛跑，黑兔说：我跑的不是最快的，但是比白兔快，请问谁跑的最快？谁跑的最慢？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：灰兔跑的最快，白兔跑的最慢"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：黑兔跑的最快，白兔跑的最慢"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：灰兔跑的最快，黑兔跑的最慢"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：白兔跑的最快，灰兔跑的最慢"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"因为黑兔说:“我跑得不是最快的,但是比白兔快”，所以黑兔跑第二,白兔跑第三,灰兔跑第一。","auto":true},{"no":23,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"有A、B、C、D、E五个自然数，其中A＜B，E>C>D，D>B，E>A，那么五个自然数大小顺序是？（ ）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：E>C>D>B>A"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：A>E>C>D>B"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：E>C>D>A>B"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：C>D>A>B>E"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"由E>C>D，D>B，可以推出E>C>D>B，由A C>D>B>A，故选项A正确。","auto":true},{"no":24,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小明今年10岁，妈妈今年38岁，当小明15岁时，妈妈多少岁？（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：40"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：32"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：28"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：43"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"由题意可知，小明增加了5岁，妈妈的年龄为38+5=43岁。","auto":true},{"no":25,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"观察下图，判断哪句话为假？（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818111512677.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：小猫有一个黑色的鼻子"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：蝙蝠有两只眼睛"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：小猫看起来很高兴"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：熊有三只耳朵"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":1,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"可以通过四种方式添加新角色（不包括复制已有角色）：选择一个角色、绘制、随机、上传角色。（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"有4种方法可以添加新角色，分别为：上传角色、生成随机角色、绘制角色和角色库选择角色。","auto":true},{"no":2,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"角色的造型可以切换，舞台的背景不能切换。（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"角色和背景的造型都可以切换。","auto":true},{"no":3,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"在背景的外观模块里，没有切换角色造型的积木。（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"在背景的脚本区里，没有切换角色造型的积木。","auto":true},{"no":4,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"角色“气球”的造型与程序如图所示。运行程序后，气球会切换为紫色的造型。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818113424013.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"根据程序可知，最后1个积木会将气球切换为黄色造型，故运行程序后，气球会切换为黄色的造型。","auto":true},{"no":5,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"蜜蜂角色的初始位置在舞台中心，程序如下图所示，运行程序后，蜜蜂移动的轨迹为一个三角形。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818113919161.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"运行程序后，角色面向右方移动100步，然后左转120度向前方移动100步，最后再左转120度向前方移动100步，每次移动的步数和角度都相同，轨迹为正三角形。","auto":true},{"no":6,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"运行下列程序后，角色面向90方向。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818114383801.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"角色初始方向为90，右转时方向值增加，左转时方向值减少，90+60-30+60=180，角色最终面向180度方向。","auto":true},{"no":7,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"赛车在舞台上左右来回移动，要让赛车的车头总是朝向前进的方向并且车轮不朝上，需要将赛车的旋转方式设为任意旋转。（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"角色的旋转方式有3种，分别为任意旋转、左右翻转、不可旋转，想让赛车在舞台上来回移动，车头就要朝向赛车前进的方向，可以将旋转方式设为左右翻转。","auto":true},{"no":8,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"背景和角色都可以添加声音。（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"A","analysis":"背景和角色都可以添加声音。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"运行下列程序后，声音的音量是100。（ ）"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230509/16836064168594.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"音量的初始值为100，音量增加-50，也就是减少50，此时音量的值为50。","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"判断题","stem":[{"t":"一只蜗牛从8米深的井底往上爬，它每次上爬2米下滑1米，爬6次蜗牛才能爬出井。（　）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：正确"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：错误"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"根据题意，可以知道最后的2米只需要1次就可以了，那么就要看前面的6米需要爬几次，它每次爬2米滑下1米，说明每次只能往前进1米，那么前面的6米就需要6次，加上最后的一次，一共7次可以爬出井口。","auto":true},{"no":1,"type":"问答题","stem":[{"t":"和平使者"},{"t":"1. 准备工作"},{"t":"（1）删除小猫角色；"},{"t":"（2）选择背景Nebula，Space，删除默认的白色背景；"},{"t":"（3）选择角色Dove。"},{"t":"2. 功能实现"},{"t":"（1）点击绿旗，角色Dove初始位置在舞台右下角，初始造型为dove-a，初始背景为Nebula；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818116318400.png"},{"t":"（2）角色Dove从舞台右下角煽动着翅膀，飞到舞台左上角；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818116536031.png"},{"t":"（3）角色Dove到达舞台左上角后，背景切换为Space；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818116739117.png"},{"t":"（4）角色Dove从舞台左上角煽动着翅膀，飞到舞台中间位置。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818116905271.png"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"","auto":false},{"no":2,"type":"问答题","stem":[{"t":"潜水"},{"t":"暑假小雨和爸爸去玩了潜水，他见到了各种各样的海洋生物。"},{"t":"1. 准备工作"},{"t":"（1）添加背景“Underwater 2”；"},{"t":"（2）删除小猫角色，添加角色“Diver2”、“Fish”、“Jellyfish”、“Shark”；"},{"t":"（3）为背景添加声音“Xylo2”。"},{"t":"2. 功能实现"},{"t":"（1）点击绿旗，播放背景音乐“Xylo2”；"},{"t":"（2）角色的初始位置如下图所示；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818118134943.png"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818118375220.png"},{"t":"（4）Diver2说完后，Fish说“你好，我是小丑鱼。”2秒；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818118536072.png"},{"t":"（5）Fish说完后，Diver2向上游动，说“这里还有鲨鱼和水母呢”2秒；"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818118742896.png"},{"t":"（6）Driver2说完后，水母切换四次造型，鲨鱼说“离我远点，我很危险！”2秒。"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20230418/16818118891291.png"},{"t":"（3）Diver2在舞台左边出现，游到Fish旁边说“看，这里有一条鱼。”2秒；"}],"options":[],"answer":null,"analysis":"","auto":false}],"durationMin":60,"totalScore":100,"passScore":60,"source":"leledati","tags":{"year":"2022","type":"真题","progress":"未开始"}}